{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Factorial","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>阶乘 · Factorial</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>非负整数的**阶乘（factorial）**定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n0!=1,\\qquad n!=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}k=1\\cdot2\\cdots n\\quad(n\\ge1).\n</div>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math inline\">(n+1)!=(n+1)n!</span>。例如 <span class=\"math inline\">3!=1\\cdot2\\cdot3=6</span>；约定 <span class=\"math inline\">0!=1</span> 与空乘积的值一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/calc.gamma-function?anchor=definition\">Gamma 函数</a>把这一整数序列延伸到正实参数，满足 <span class=\"math inline\">\\Gamma(n+1)=n!</span>。<a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=factorial-as-area\">斯特林公式讲义</a>从阶乘积分研究 <span class=\"math inline\">n!</span> 的增长。</p>\n","id":"calc.factorial.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.factorial","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"阶乘"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Factorial","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>阶乘 · Factorial</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>非负整数的**阶乘（factorial）**定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n0!=1,\\qquad n!=\\prod_{k=1}^{n}k=1\\cdot2\\cdots n\\quad(n\\ge1).\n</div>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math inline\">(n+1)!=(n+1)n!</span>。例如 <span class=\"math inline\">3!=1\\cdot2\\cdot3=6</span>；约定 <span class=\"math inline\">0!=1</span> 与空乘积的值一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"#/learn/calc.gamma-function?anchor=definition\">Gamma 函数</a>把这一整数序列延伸到正实参数，满足 <span class=\"math inline\">\\Gamma(n+1)=n!</span>。<a href=\"#/learn/calc.stirling-formula?articles=calc.stirling-formula.gamma-integral&amp;anchor=factorial-as-area\">斯特林公式讲义</a>从阶乘积分研究 <span class=\"math inline\">n!</span> 的增长。</p>\n","id":"calc.factorial.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.factorial","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"阶乘"}],"available_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"english_title":"Factorial","id":"calc.factorial.main","legacy":true